# demo_float_playingcard_3 Specification

## Overview

`demo_float_playingcard_3` is a scene-driven demo launcher for floating playing cards using asimov's scene system.

## Usage

```bash
python demo_float_playingcard_3.py [options]
```

## Arguments

| Argument | Type | Default | Description |
|----------|------|---------|-------------|
| `--device` | int | conf.CAP_DEVICE | Camera device index |

## Features

- Scene-driven architecture using asimov.scene
- Hand tracking integration
- Floating card overlay on palms
- Configurable via asimov configuration

## Exit

- Press ESC to quit
